Suggests: bluez, bluez-obexd
Description: full-featured Bluetooth manager for the terminal (ratatui)
 bluetuith-rs is a terminal user interface for managing Bluetooth adapters
 and devices over BlueZ D-Bus. It provides adapter power/discovery control,
 device pairing and connection, OBEX Object Push file transfers with progress,
 AVRCP media playback, PAN networking, audio profiles and a pairing agent.
 .
 The interface is built with ratatui and supports mouse input, configurable
 keybindings, nine colour themes, search/filter and a --demo mode that runs
 without Bluetooth hardware.
